  "findings": {
    "why_paying_below_band_is_inverted": "envs/walker_ragdoll_env.py sets stand_height = clip((z - 0.65)/0.60, 0, 1), so locomotion terms already pay up to 58.3% below the z = 1.0 m standing band; paying more locomotion below the band rewards lunging and crawling, whereas zeroing locomotion outside (z > 1.0, upright > 0.7) forces the planner to stand before advancing.",
    "two_state_termination_rule": "Enabling terminate_when_unhealthy=True unconditionally inside _evaluate() arms _ever_healthy on the first frame z crosses 1.001 m during a dynamic stand-up from the floor and punishes the subsequent settling wobble by -500. Enabling it only when plan() starts already settled in standing posture (z0 > 1.12 m, upright0 > 0.80) prevents diving from a stand without booby-trapping recovery.",
    "layer3_gait_verdict": "Under the corrected gait objective, in-band time rises from 12.1%-18.2% to 41.2%-54.2%, continuous standing runs reach 2.98 s-3.02 s (crossing the 2.0 s threshold no published MPC or learned arm had crossed), and the share of approach closed while standing rises from 0.279 to 0.612 (at v_ref=1.1 m/s) and 1.018 (at v_ref=0.8 m/s, 11.95 m closed standing vs -0.21 m while down).",
    "layer1_action_imitability_verdict": "Holding control knots for 5 steps with slew-rate regularisation cuts consecutive-action MSE by 6x-11x (0.7567 -> 0.0703-0.1252, dropping from 1.99x action energy to 0.38x-0.39x) and allows a held-out ridge regressor to beat the constant-zero predictor by 10.85%-12.64% where both argmin and 1-step elite-mean previously lost.",
    "layer2_q_probe_verdict": "Fixing the missing prediction centering in bench_planner_q.within_state_metrics and centering training returns per plan puts state_only at 0.0000 by construction (instead of -2.095) and raises joint_interactions on mpc_candidates.npz from within_r2 = -0.3507 (pearson 0.0043) to within_r2_centered = +0.0130 (pearson +0.1152), matching the theoretical ~1/H = 1% variance share of a 1-step action in a 100-step random rollout. Even with 5-step knots (pearson +0.1500), the pre-registered Q(s, a) gate (>= 0.30 R2, >= 0.50 pearson, >= 0.50 elite hit) remains closed."
